Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.47,0:00:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.09,0:00:26.69,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.05,0:00:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.45,0:00:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.01,0:00:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Your moves!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.75,0:01:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,That Millennium Eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.71,0:01:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It somehow lets Pegasus see all\Nof the cards in Kaiba's hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.75,0:01:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, tell me you're\Nnot serious. Wow, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.09,0:01:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you said that\Nthing had magical powers,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.27,0:01:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,but I didn't know that it\Ncould help him win duels, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.03,0:01:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,How's anybody supposed to win\Nagainst that kind of power?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.01,0:01:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Man!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.92,0:01:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, I wouldn't count Kaiba\Nout of this match just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.89,0:01:26.27,Default,,0,0,0,,He may be trailing now,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.47,0:01:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,but he didn't get to be world champion\Nwithout learning a few comeback tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.31,0:01:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,This is absurd.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.59,0:01:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's as if Pegasus can see\Nmy cards before I play them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.67,0:01:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.23,0:01:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I just need to trust my old skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.09,0:01:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.09,0:01:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,No card in my hand can\Ndefeat the deranged rabbit,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.25,0:01:46.39,Default,,0,0,0,,but at least I can\Nprotect myself from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.47,0:01:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.49,0:01:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I have two monsters on the\Nfield guarding my life points.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.33,0:01:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Your turn, Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.05,0:01:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,As you wish,yber boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.15,0:01:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me something, my old friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.73,0:02:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you like watching\Ncartoons in your youth?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.43,0:02:04.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that a no?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.15,0:02:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyber, you're even more\Ncold-hearted than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.21,0:02:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,For me, they were the absolute best.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.47,0:02:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And none was closer to my heart than\Nthe misadventures of one tricky hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.55,0:02:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I am speaking, of course, of Funny Bunny.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.23,0:02:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Such a clever rabbit, forever evading Ruff\NRuff McDog and his long paw of the law.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.37,0:02:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,So how I'd spend hours\Nwatching their never
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.29,0:02:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,-ending antics and perpetual\Ngame of hide-and-seek.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.85,0:02:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Just make your move!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.25,0:02:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,But, Kyber, that is my move.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.83,0:02:38.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Your move's a cartoon?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.67,0:02:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Not just a cartoon, you simpleton.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.03,0:02:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,An entire magical cartoon world!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.71,0:02:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome, Kyber, to Toon World!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.55,0:03:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Let the fun begin
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.83,0:03:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be kidding. Toon World?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.99,0:03:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks more like some kid's pop-up book
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.21,0:03:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,To me, I've never even\Nheard of this wacky cod.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.39,0:03:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Toon World, it sounds familiar Hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.93,0:03:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I think that Pegasus' Dark\NRabbit just pulled a Houdini
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.03,0:03:24.27,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's the magic of Toon World?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.37,0:03:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you can make your creatures disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.55,0:03:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Come now, even cartoon bunnies\Ncan't vanish into thin air.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.79,0:03:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,My Dark Rabbit simply\Nwent to his new home.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.45,0:03:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's a home that will prove\Nto be the safest of havens.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.13,0:03:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,For as soon as I close\Nthat hardbook cover,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.15,0:03:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Toon World's bindings can't\Nbe penetrated by anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.83,0:03:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,But don't worry,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.19,0:03:48.07,Default,,0,0,0,,my Dark Rabbit won't lock himself away in
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.15,0:03:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,those pages without\Nfirst paying you a visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.35,0:03:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Dark Rabbit attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.67,0:03:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Bad hair day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.27,0:04:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Quite a painful chapter in your Battle\NOx's life, wouldn't you say, Kaiba Boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.21,0:04:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd race for your revenge,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.85,0:04:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,but my Dark Rabbit's already\Nsafely back inside Toon World.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.03,0:04:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps the next time that he comes out\Nto give you a thumping you can try taking
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.77,0:04:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,a swing at him You coward Well that's not\Nfair He'll keep doing this the entire duel
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.47,0:04:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see here. I can't attack his rabbit\Nso I'll just lay out this for later.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.15,0:04:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like it's my turn again
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.65,0:04:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And my chance to show\Noff even more toon power
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.63,0:04:49.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And what better way to demonstrate\Nthan on a card I stole from you
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.25,0:04:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,My blue eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.43,0:05:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'll show you what your beast\Nis capable of under my control.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.91,0:05:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue eyes, white dragon, awaken
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.61,0:05:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And cross the threshold into Toon World
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.27,0:05:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Meet the new and improved\NBlue-Eyes Tomb Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.77,0:05:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you've stripped him of his pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.97,0:05:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, I've transformed this legendary\Nbeast into his most supreme form.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.31,0:05:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, I've made him look much more cuddly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.93,0:05:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Of all the things that Blue Eyes is,\Ncuddly sure ain't one of them. For once,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.97,0:05:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I think that Kaiba would\Nagree Let's see the
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.55,0:05:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,World champ, get out of\Nthis Blue Eyes Toon Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.39,0:05:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,attack the rude Kaiser
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.77,0:06:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,How embarrassing A world\Nchampion blasted by a
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.19,0:06:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,caricature of his own most\Ntrusted beast However,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.71,0:06:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,did that happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.51,0:06:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus, your underhanded dueling\Ntactics have gone on long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.11,0:06:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time someone put a\Nstop to your cheating ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.71,0:06:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I may not know exactly how you're\Ncheating, but somehow you can see my cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.41,0:06:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,So, I'm abandoning my present hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.65,0:06:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps if I can't see what\NI'm playing, you can't either.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.37,0:06:36.39,Default,,0,0,0,,A gutsy move.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.63,0:06:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, how do you think\NPegasus is cheating?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.13,0:06:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.57,0:06:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe he's got some hidden\Ncameras set up in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.47,0:06:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You really think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.03,0:06:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I wouldn't put anything\Npast that sleazy slime ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.31,0:06:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll tell you this,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.73,0:06:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,now that Kaiba's not even\Nlooking at his cards,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.01,0:06:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,he needs to trust more in\Nthe heart of the cards if
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.43,0:06:57.43,Default,,0,0,0,,he's gonna have any chance\Nof rescuing his brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.59,0:07:01.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, Joey sure has come a\Nlong way since our first duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.61,0:07:02.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Here he goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.77,0:07:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I've put all my faith in this next card.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.77,0:07:08.99,Default,,0,0,0,,So now let it be revealed!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.81,0:07:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, the blue-eyes white dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.17,0:07:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.08,0:07:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That's got to be the\Nluckiest draw I've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.49,0:07:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I think that draw was more\Nabout faith than luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.43,0:07:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You said it, bud.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.99,0:07:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba listened to his heart, and\Nit paid off for him big time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.57,0:07:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus, your card\Nprophesizing has failed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.07,0:07:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,And now your toon dragon\Nwill fail you as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.71,0:07:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, I've never seen a monster go up against\Na wigged-out version of himself before.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.61,0:07:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Normally, this clash would end in a draw,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.23,0:07:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,but I don't know all the rules to\NToon World, so I can't be sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.33,0:07:53.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, this is going to be such fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.77,0:07:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,A blue eye is attacking\Nhis Toon counterpart?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.45,0:08:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no end to the zany antics\Nthat could ensue from this. Wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.19,0:08:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't one of your\Nhare-brained after-school cartoons.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.01,0:08:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Toon won't escape this. Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.93,0:08:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's not right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.69,0:08:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.77,0:08:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue Eyes, attack with all your might!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.11,0:08:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,White Lightning!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.35,0:08:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.43,0:08:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.09,0:08:40.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That toon just stretched out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.25,0:08:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You should have watched\Nmore cartoons, Kyla.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.79,0:08:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,The cuddliest creature\Nnever, ever gets hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.55,0:08:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,In 3,013 episodes of Funny Bunny,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.95,0:08:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Ruff-Gruff-McDawg never laid\Na paw on our cuddly hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.87,0:08:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,No, he would try and try,\Nbut never would he succeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.51,0:09:01.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Such a clever little rabbit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.97,0:09:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,And my creatures will employ\Nthe same cleverness every
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.25,0:09:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Time you attack. Because as long\Nas my Toon World card is out
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.93,0:09:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything I throw will be just as\Nhard to pin down as my Toon Dragon
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.67,0:09:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba will get creamed\Nif all of his opponents
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.87,0:09:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,are nothing but Toons This\Nisn't fair Just because
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.29,0:09:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus invented the\Ngame Shouldn't mean he
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.25,0:09:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,can use some super card\Nthat no one knows about
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.45,0:09:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, you ever hear of Toon World?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.29,0:09:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, all I know about it is that\Nit was never put into circulation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.97,0:09:36.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It was too powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.61,0:09:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess Pegasus must have the only one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.01,0:09:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,That sounds real fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.89,0:09:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,How can anyone beat Pegasus when he\Nhas cards like that at his disposal?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.05,0:09:47.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, where were we, Kaiba boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.67,0:09:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, yes, it was my turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.41,0:09:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.53,0:09:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, let's see here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.25,0:09:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,He's folded his hands\Nso I can no longer look
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.89,0:09:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,through his eyes to see\Nwhat cards he holds.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.69,0:10:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,But perhaps I can look elsewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.77,0:10:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, a duelist of Kyber's experience\Nhas long since memorized his entire deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.85,0:10:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Every monster, every card.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.19,0:10:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,So I don't need to look through his\Neyes to see what cards he keeps.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.83,0:10:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I simply need to look through his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.45,0:10:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll play this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.97,0:10:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,A new addition to Tomb World.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.25,0:10:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,The Shine Palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.95,0:10:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Luminous, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.77,0:10:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,And it makes for quite a handy plot twist.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.71,0:10:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, the Shine Palace raises my\NToon Dragon's attack by 500 points.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.27,0:10:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,That still won't bring\Nthis story to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.43,0:10:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I beg to differ, Kaiba boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.61,0:10:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I think that I've just written\Nthe final chapter of your defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.65,0:10:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,The light energy that my\NToon Dragon absorbs from
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.47,0:10:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Shine Palace makes him\Nstronger than your blue eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.29,0:10:54.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Observe.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.73,0:11:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm no cartoon expert, but exploding\Nvolcano biceps, that's bad, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.11,0:11:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue-Eyes Toon Dragon, attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.45,0:11:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,White lightning!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.85,0:11:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Not so fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.37,0:11:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Activate magic card!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.49,0:11:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Negate attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.49,0:11:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,So that was the card he\Nplayed two turns back.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.51,0:11:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Clever move, Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.13,0:11:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But don't forget,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.59,0:11:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,the defensive magic of Negate Attack\Nremains on the field for just one turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.61,0:11:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Or as the threat of my\NToondragon will endure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.87,0:11:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,My turn now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.79,0:11:50.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I bought some time, but I won't be able\Nto block that Toondragon's attack again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.17,0:11:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd have to destroy that comic\Nmonstrosity here and now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.81,0:11:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.72,0:11:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,not only will I have lost this duel,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.77,0:12:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'll have lost my only chance\Nof winning my brother's soul back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.55,0:12:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to trust in my\Ndeck for the both of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.77,0:12:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.85,0:12:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, Shadow Spell!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.47,0:12:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.55,0:12:22.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Now not only can your toon not move, but\Nhis attack power is lowered by 700 points.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.95,0:12:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare Kaiba shackle a free and\Nwondrous spirit such as my Blue-Eyes Toon?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.95,0:12:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like imprisoning Joy itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.27,0:12:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,He will pay for interrupting my fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.45,0:12:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like Toons don't\Nalways get the last laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.63,0:12:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue-Eyes White Lightning attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.93,0:12:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.09,0:12:52.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.00,0:12:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba sent that dude back\Nto the drawing board.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.03,0:12:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,He pulled it off. Impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.51,0:13:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Now do you understand that nothing will\Nstop me from rescuing my brother Pegasus?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.37,0:13:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Even destroying my own blue eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.95,0:13:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, Kaiba boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.91,0:13:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Your treasured blue eyes white dragons\Nmean so very much to you, don't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.77,0:13:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, as creator of dual monsters,\NI'm truly touched by your devotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.73,0:13:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,but
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.25,0:13:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,when will you learn that\Nthe same devotion is
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.09,0:13:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,not returned by the blue\Neyes for as you'll see
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.69,0:13:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,they are not so loyal
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.67,0:13:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,go dragon capture jar
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.61,0:13:40.47,Default,,0,0,0,,this will make two blue eyes that I've\Nstolen from you won't it now you must hate me
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.95,0:13:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.97,0:13:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Now all of your dragon's\Ndefense points have been
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.41,0:13:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,transferred to my jar where\Nthey'll be at my disposal,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.05,0:13:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.96,0:14:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't let Pegasus steal another\None of my dragons with that jar.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.35,0:14:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to find a way to destroy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.45,0:14:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, Pegasus.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.89,0:14:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm playing this in defense mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.53,0:14:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Then for my turn, I'll place\Nthis magic card face down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.91,0:14:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,And bring out the Dragon\NPiper! Defense mode!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.47,0:14:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,That could only mean one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.89,0:14:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus is planning to draw\Nmy dragon under his control.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.13,0:14:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You read my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.39,0:14:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,And soon I will make him a toon just\Nlike I did your other blue eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.03,0:14:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And then the fun will\Nbegin all over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.97,0:14:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.51,0:14:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Not if I can shatter that\NDragon Piper right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.57,0:14:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm invoking the powers\Nof the Sword Stalker!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.77,0:14:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Now attack the Dragon Piper!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.91,0:14:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Vengeance Strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.27,0:14:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you forget about the magic\Ncard I just placed, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.09,0:15:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a little doodad called Doppelganger.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.11,0:15:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It can copy anything on the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.97,0:15:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I'll have it copy your crush card.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.77,0:15:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And now I'll infect my Dragon Piper.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.97,0:15:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,With it? Oh no, but\NKaiba's just declared an
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.43,0:15:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,attack on that dragon\Npiper his stalker will
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.11,0:15:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,be charging right into\Na trap yeah and it's
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.05,0:15:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,too late for him to do\Na single thing about it
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.83,0:15:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,hurry up and call up\Nyour attack kaiba it's a
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.25,0:15:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,trap i'm afraid this is\Nfar worse than a trap
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.19,0:15:47.05,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a virus,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.53,0:15:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,and it incapacitates every one of Kaiba's
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.31,0:15:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,monsters that have more\Nthan 1,500 attack points,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.25,0:15:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,including the ones in his deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.47,0:15:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,All of my cards are becoming infected!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.65,0:16:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what you get, Kaiba boy,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.45,0:16:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,when you stack your\Ndeck with monster cards
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.59,0:16:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,that all have more than\N1,500 offense points.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.07,0:16:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.35,0:16:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba's getting done in by the same\Ncard that he tried to beat Yugi with.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.97,0:16:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,This can't be it that crush card totally\Nobliterated his deck all of my cards gone
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.37,0:16:22.71,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the only one left that the virus
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.79,0:16:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,didn't affect so it's\Nthe only card I can play
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.43,0:16:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I've used Reborn the monster\Nto revive Soggy the Clown.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.69,0:16:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your last move, and you're\Ngoing to spend it reviving a clown.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.93,0:16:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes, that's right,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.27,0:16:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba He's the best you\Ncan do with my virus still
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.67,0:16:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,about shame when you consider\Nall that's on the line
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.37,0:16:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba, I've tried my very best.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.65,0:16:49.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Your best failed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.63,0:16:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Mikuri Box, emerge and attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.95,0:17:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.85,0:17:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I am so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.97,0:17:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.93,0:17:19.11,Default,,0,0,0,,There are no more cards you can play.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.37,0:17:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Therefore, you lose, Kaiba boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.39,0:17:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And you've lost much more than\Njust this duel, haven't you, Kaiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.33,0:17:31.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You've lost the only chance you\Nhad at rescuing your baby brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.19,0:17:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You let him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.07,0:17:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,But don't worry, my dear friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.25,0:17:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I will spare you the agony of\Ncarrying on in this world without him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.01,0:17:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.09,0:17:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It is the final fate of\Nyour soul, Seto Kaiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.85,0:17:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to your new home, a\Nplace of solitude and seclusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.57,0:18:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,And while your soul is away, your body\Nwill be employed as my obedient servant.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.25,0:18:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,The Brothers Kaiba, one in each hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.69,0:18:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,But even though your\Ncards are so very close,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.01,0:18:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,your souls have never been further apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.93,0:18:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,At least when I had Mokava locked up,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.81,0:18:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,you were both still living\Nwithin the same dimension.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.81,0:18:19.17,Default,,0,0,0,,But now you're worlds apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.83,0:18:23.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Take away that empty shell.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.25,0:18:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Teach it to wash dishes or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.35,0:18:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, tell me I didn't just\Nsee what I think I saw. Kaiba!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.39,0:18:35.39,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gone too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.73,0:18:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Just because he was only trying\Nto help his little brother out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.49,0:18:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,He was like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.35,0:18:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He just wanted to save\Nsomeone he cared for.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.47,0:18:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, Pegasus?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.31,0:18:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you to toy with\Nour friends? Our families?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.85,0:18:55.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let you get away with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.23,0:19:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Just try and stop me, little Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.51,0:19:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi-oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.03,0:19:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.94,0:19:20.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I do believe I've just sensed Yugi tapping\Ninto the power of his Millennium Item.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.09,0:19:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.17,0:19:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Pegasus, it won't be long now\Ntill I put an end to your games.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.51,0:19:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi boy,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.67,0:19:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,don't forget that you still have\Nto make it through the remaining
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.57,0:19:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,rounds of this tournament to even\Nwin the privilege of challenging me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.67,0:19:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Rest assured, I'll be at the finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.25,0:19:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,But the true privilege will\Nbe defeating you and undoing
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.45,0:19:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,all the evil acts you've\Ncommitted against my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.05,0:19:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I look forward to your\Nfinest efforts, Yugi boy,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.81,0:19:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,and wonderful performances\Nfrom all our finalists.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.97,0:19:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You truly are the best of the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.89,0:19:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,The creme de la creme.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.03,0:20:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,But even so, with the power of my millennium\Neye, nothing will keep me from victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.25,0:20:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even Yugi and his Millennium Puzzle!
